{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30224","headline":"送西川杜司空赴镇 · 薛逢","name":"送西川杜司空赴镇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑眉玄髪尚依然，紫绶金章五十年。\n三入凤池操国柄，八分龙节付兵权。\n东周城阙中天外，西蜀楼台落日边。\n莫遣洪罏旷真宰，九流人物待陶甄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}